<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink162-kilavi">
        ituvumatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        This one is also that [= the previous one].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink162">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>nīttunī riruṅkaḻi yiraitērn tuṇṭu</l>
<l>pūkkamaḻ potumparc cēkkun</l>
<l>tuṟaivaṉ collō piṟavā yiṉavē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>As for the words of the man from the seashore</l>
        <l>In which the small, white crow of the vast seashore</l>
        <l>Rests in a grove in which flowers are fragrant,</l>
        <l>After having seatched for meat in the backwaters of a dark nature, having swum [there],</l>
        <l>They have become something else!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
